<p>Throw a huge boulder, dealing <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>Strength 100">124, 170, 206, 236, 262</acronym> physical damage and knocking targets back <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">4, 5, 6, 7, 8</acronym> tiles within radius 1.</p><p>The damage will increase with your Strength.</p>